		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,</p><p>En fait les 2 ou pas , mais il est vrai que mon exemple n&#039;était pas des plus parlant.</p><p>Possibilité 1 :&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; Possibilité 2 :&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;| cas concrès&#160; &#160; <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; <br />INST1&#160; DB1 US1&#160; PORT1 |&#160; INST1 DB1 US1&#160; PORT1&#160; |&#160; TES&#160; &#160;DB_YT&#160; &#160;US_YT&#160; 60800<br />INST1&#160; DB2 US2&#160; PORT2 |&#160; INST2 DB2 US2&#160; PORT2&#160; |&#160; TES&#160; &#160;DB_XT&#160; &#160;US_XT&#160; 60810<br />INST1&#160; DB3 US3&#160; PORT3 |&#160; INST3 DB3 US3&#160; PORT3&#160; |&#160; TES&#160; &#160;DB_ZT&#160; &#160;US_ZT&#160; 60820<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; <br />INST2&#160; DB4 US4&#160; PORT4 |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; REC&#160; &#160;DB_YR&#160; &#160;US_YR 60830<br />INST2&#160; DB5 US5&#160; PORT5 |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; REC&#160; &#160;DB_XR&#160; &#160;US_XR 60840<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#1